This saves a fixed snapshot with no background polling or startup network requests. Refresh display states reads known controls; Configure allows an explicit rescan. Advanced or risky entities remain disabled by default and must be enabled separately. Brightness zero, power, input, HDR, modes, connection and layout actions can make a display unreadable or unavailable. Synchronization, groups and global Mac actions may affect displays outside this selection; review BetterDisplay settings first. Values represent app state, not physical acknowledgement. Confirmation saves controls without writing to the Mac. Event webhooks are a separate opt-in in Configure.

